# setuptools 83.0.0 closes GHSA-h35f-9h28-mq5c (MANIFEST.in exclusion bypass in
# sdist via Unicode NFC/NFD normalization collision on macOS APFS/HFS+). This
# pin previously conflicted with torch 2.12.0's `setuptools<82` cap and required
# a uv override file to resolve at all; torch 2.13.0 raised that cap to
# `setuptools>=77.0.3`, so the pin now resolves normally and overrides.txt has
# been retired.
setuptools==84.0.0

