# PyTorch & GNN
# torch 2.13.0 closes CVE-2025-3000 / GHSA-rrmf-rvhw-rf47 / PYSEC-2025-194
# (memory corruption in torch.jit.script, vulnerable <=2.12.1, patched 2.13.0).
# It also drops the `setuptools<82` build-metadata cap that 2.12.0 declared,
# which is why overrides.txt is no longer needed - see the setuptools note above.
torch==2.13.0
